---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <main>
    <div
      class="mx-auto grid max-w-5xl grid-cols-1 gap-4 gap-y-16 px-4 py-30 md:grid-cols-4 md:gap-y-28 md:px-8"
    >
      <div class="col-span-full grid grid-cols-subgrid gap-y-14 md:gap-y-24">
        <div class="col-span-full grid grid-cols-subgrid gap-y-10 md:gap-y-14">
          <article class="col-span-full grid grid-cols-subgrid gap-y-16 md:gap-y-28">
            <div class="col-span-full grid grid-cols-subgrid gap-y-12 md:gap-y-18">
              <header class="col-span-full">
                <h1 class="hero-heading-text">
                  The blacksmith<br /> and the software
                </h1>
              </header>
              <div class="col-span-full grid grid-cols-subgrid gap-y-6 md:gap-y-10">
                <p class="heading-text col-span-3 col-start-2">
                  Quando il fabbro usa un martello per forgiare un coltello, sta essenzialmente
                  impiegando uno strumento preesistente per crearne uno nuovo con uno scopo diverso.
                  Allo stesso modo, oggi possiamo utilizzare un modello linguistico di grandi
                  dimensioni per scrivere software destinato a una vasta gamma di esigenze: questa
                  pratica è chiamata vibe coding.
                </p>
                <p class="heading-text col-span-3 col-start-2">
                  La programmazione non è mai stata così accessibile a chiunque, indipendentemente
                  dal proprio background tecnico. In questo workshop pratico esploreremo e
                  discuteremo questa pratica applicata al creative coding, introducendo alcuni
                  concetti chiave, buone pratiche e avvertenze riguardo al vibe coding.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <footer class="col-span-full grid grid-cols-subgrid gap-y-10 md:gap-y-14">
              <p class="body-text col-span-3 col-start-1">
                "The blacksmith and the software" è realizzato all'interno del <a
                  class="decoration-skip-ink-auto whitespace-nowrap underline decoration-solid"
                  href="https://wud-bz.it">World Usability Day Bolzano</a
                >, NOI Techpark, 7 novembre 2025
              </p>
              <dl class="col-span-full grid grid-cols-subgrid gap-y-2">
                <div>
                  <dt class="body-text">Host</dt>
                  <dd class="body-text">
                    <a
                      class="decoration-skip-ink-auto underline decoration-solid"
                      href="https://rlmodugno.com">Rocco Modugno</a
                    >
                  </dd>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <dt class="body-text">Co-Host, Design</dt>
                  <dd class="body-text">Andrea Maffei</dd>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <dt class="body-text">Development</dt>
                  <dd class="body-text">Michele Maffei</dd>
                </div>
              </dl>
            </footer>
          </article>
          <aside class="col-span-2 col-start-1">
            <h2 class="body-text font-medium">Useful Links & References</h2>
            <ul>
              <li class="body-text">
                <a
                  class="decoration-skip-ink-auto underline decoration-solid"
                  href="https://reas.com">Casey Reas</a
                >
              </li>
              <li class="body-text">
                <a
                  class="decoration-skip-ink-auto underline decoration-solid"
                  href="https://natureofcode.com">The nature of code</a
                >
              </li>
              <li class="body-text">
                <a
                  class="decoration-skip-ink-auto underline decoration-solid"
                  href="https://processing.org">Processing Organization</a
                >
              </li>
              <li class="body-text">
                Simon Willison - <a
                  class="decoration-skip-ink-auto underline decoration-solid"
                  href="https://simonwillison.net/2025/Mar/11/using-llms-for-code/"
                  >Using LLMs for code</a
                >
              </li>
            </ul>
          </aside>
        </div>
        <nav aria-label="Actions" class="col-span-full grid grid-cols-subgrid gap-y-2">
          <a
            class="font-body col-span-1 col-start-1 rounded-full bg-[#EEEEEE] px-3 pt-3 pb-[calc(var(--spacing)*3.5)] text-center text-lg leading-none font-medium text-[#222222]"
            href="/gallery">Gallery</a
          >
          <a
            class="font-body col-span-1 col-start-2 rounded-full bg-[#EEEEEE] px-3 pt-3 pb-[calc(var(--spacing)*3.5)] text-center text-lg leading-none font-medium text-[#222222]"
            href="/upload">Upload a Tool</a
          >
        </nav>
      </div>
      <section class="col-span-full grid grid-cols-subgrid gap-y-12 md:gap-y-18">
        <h2 class="heading-text col-span-3 col-start-1">Tales from the Developer</h2>
        <p class="body-text col-span-3 col-start-2">
          To err is human but to arr is pirate!! A pirate is a man that is weak to achieve but too
          strong to steal from even the greatest achiever. Without the messy paperwork. Ahoy! lets
          trouble the water! I'd love to drop anchor in your lagoon. The rougher the seas, the
          smoother we sail. Ahoy! And that was done without a single drop of rum... Me I'm
          Dishonest. And A Dishonest Man You Can Always Trust To Be Dishonest. Honestly Its The
          Honest Ones You Want To Watch Out For Because You Never Know When They Are Going To Do
          Something Completely Stupid! Not all treasure is silver and gold Yarrrr! there be ony two
          ranks of leader amongst us pirates! Captain and if your really notorious then it's Cap'n!
          you know, thats the 2nd time I'v watched that man sail away with my ship. Right from the
          Voyage og Noah, surviving was by sailing. Avast ye! and sail against the tides. Whats a
          pirate's favorite fast food restaurant? Arrrrbys!
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
